$$
xyz = k^{1/3} \cdot \left(\frac{k}{2}\right)^{1/3} \cdot \left(\frac{k}{4}\right)^{1/3}
= \left(k \cdot \frac{k}{2} \cdot \frac{k}{4} \right)^{1/3}
